        how: [L('Run and look at the 100% crop.', 'Executa i mira el retall al 100%.', 'Ejecuta y mira el recorte al 100%.'), L('Add <b>UltralyticsDetectorProvider</b> (bbox/face_yolov8m.pt) and <b>FaceDetailer</b>: image from VAE Decode, model, clip, vae, positive, negative, and BBOX_DETECTOR → bbox_detector.', 'Afegeix <b>UltralyticsDetectorProvider</b> (bbox/face_yolov8m.pt) i <b>FaceDetailer</b>: image de VAE Decode, model, clip, vae, positive, negative, i BBOX_DETECTOR → bbox_detector.', 'Añade <b>UltralyticsDetectorProvider</b> (bbox/face_yolov8m.pt) y <b>FaceDetailer</b>: image de VAE Decode, model, clip, vae, positive, negative, y BBOX_DETECTOR → bbox_detector.'), L('Its <b>image</b> → Save Image. Run.', 'La seva <b>image</b> → Save Image. Executa.', 'Su <b>image</b> → Save Image. Ejecuta.')],
